                        <div class="person__header">
                            <h3 class="type-h6">Peter Guinness</h3>

                                                            <p class="type-body-s">Doctor Herdal</p>
                            
                            <div class="person__header__flex">
                                
                                                            </div>
                        </div>

                                                    <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-5-8611">
                                <article class="person-dialog">
                                                                            <div class="person-dialog__image img-fit rounded">
                                            <img width="450" height="600" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAcIAAAJYAQMAAADLw3S+AAAABlBMVEUAAAD///+l2Z/dAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAADhJREFUeNrtwQENAAAAwqD3T20PBxQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD8G4fwAAHAiGHlAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC" class="attachment-3:4@450 size-3:4@450 lazyload" alt=""  decoding="async"  data-src="https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-450x600.jpg" data-srcset="https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-450x600.jpg 450w, https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-150x200.jpg 150w, https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-300x400.jpg 300w, https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-850x1133.jpg 850w" data-sizes="auto" data-eio-rwidth="450" data-eio-rheight="600" /><noscript><img width="450" height="600" src="https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-450x600.jpg" class="attachment-3:4@450 size-3:4@450" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 340px) 90vw, 300px" decoding="async" srcset="https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-450x600.jpg 450w, https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-150x200.jpg 150w, https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-300x400.jpg 300w, https://www.arcolatheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Peter-Guiness-Headshot-1-850x1133.jpg 850w" data-eio="l" /></noscript>
                                        </div>
                                    
                                    <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                        <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                            <h2 class="type-h3">Peter Guinness</h2>

                                                                                            <p class="type-h5">Doctor Herdal</p>
                                                                                    </div>

                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Peter trained at the Central School of Speech and Drama.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Theatre roles include Buckingham in </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Richard III</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and Guy in </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">After Independence</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> at the Arcola, and recently Brabantio in Tom Morris’s production of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Othello</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> at the Theatre Royal Haymarket. Over the years his theatre credits include leading roles at the Citizens Theatre Glasgow, the RSC, the Donmar Warehouse, Manchester Royal Exchange, the Old Vic and the Young Vic, the Chichester Festival Theatre, Birmingham Rep and the Orange Tree Theatre Richmond.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Numerous film credits include </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Zach Snyder’s Justice League, Official Secrets, King Arthur: Legend of the Sword, Centurion, The Conclave, Secret Passage, Greenfingers, Sleepy Hollow, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">and </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Alien 3. </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Most recently, he worked alongside Joel Edgerton and Callum Turner in George Clooney’s </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Boys on the Boat</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Television credits include the leading antagonist Petr Kovac in series three of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Jack Ryan</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, Leif in </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Girlfriend Experience, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Sir Ector</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">in</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Cursed, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">General Malcolm in</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Pennyworth </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">and</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">General Dreedle</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> in Catch 22, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Major Burov in</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Chernobyl, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Dimitri</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Polyakov in</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> The Assets, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pushkin in </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Strikeback, </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tomas De Torquemada in</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Da Vinci’s Demons</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and Ari in </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Adventures of Merlin</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">. Most recently he appeared as Sir George Chapman in </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Red Eye</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Radio credits include </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Picture of Dorian Gray</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Never Never Land</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Waves</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">. Audio includes </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ministry of Chance</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Strangeness in Space</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">. </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Phantom of the Opera, Dracula’s Guest and Other Dark Tales, Blake’s 7: Point of No Return, Judge Dredd: Grud is Dead</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and several episodes of <em>Doctor Who</em>.</span></p>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                                            </li>
                                                                                                                                        
