                                    <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                        <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                            <h2 class="type-h3">Josh Picton</h2>

                                                                                            <p class="type-h5">Understudy Ragnar Brovik</p>
                                                                                    </div>

                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Joshua Picton is an actor and theatre maker, trained at East 15 Acting School. His professional credits include stage performances at the Vaults, the Edinburgh Fringe, and across the UK on national tour, as well as audiobook narration. Though this marks his Arcola debut as a performer, Joshua has been a proud supporter of the Arcola Mental Health Community Company for the past four years. He is thrilled to join <em>The Master Builder</em> at a theatre that means so much to him.</span></p>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
