                                    <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                        <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                            <h2 class="type-h3">Ryan Wichert</h2>

                                                                                            <p class="type-h5">Ragnar Brovik</p>
                                                                                    </div>

                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Film includes: </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Control</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Studio Canal), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Entropy </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(Amazon Prime), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Munich</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Netflix), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Behemoth</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Black Mandala Films), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Spencer</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Shoebox Films), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Keeper</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (20th Century Studios), and </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Another Mother’s Son</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Bill Kenwright Films). </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">TV includes: </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Maxton Hall </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(Amazon MGM Studios),</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Berlin Noir </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(AppleTV), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Queens Gambit </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(Netflix), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pitch Perfect: Bumper in Berlin</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Universal), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Notruf Hafenkante</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (ZDF Studios), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">How To Sell Drugs Online (Fast)</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Netflix), and</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Nazi Megastructures S4-5 </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(National Geographic). </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Theatre includes: </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lowest of the Low</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (National Theatre Germany + Turkey), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Importance of Being Earnest</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Euro Theatre Bonn), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Wuthering Heights </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(Euro Theatre Bonn), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Cherry Orchard </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(Arcola Theatre). </span></p>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
