                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p>Mehmet Ergen is the co-founder and current Artistic Director of the Arcola Theatre, London, founding and co curating Arcola’s annual Grimeborn Opera Festival as part of this role.</p>
<p>He was co-founder and the first Artistic Director of the Southwark Playhouse, Associate Producer at the Battersea Arts Centre, Opera Season Advisor and judge for BBC Radio drama.</p>

