<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Opera credits include: </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Die Fledermaus </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">(Opera Theatre St. Louis),</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> La Traviata</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (LA </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Opera, US), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tamerlano, Belshazzar</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (The Grange Festival),</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Parsifal, Tristan und Isolde, Tosca</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (San Francisco Opera), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">La Traviata</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (San Francisco Opera), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Brand New </span></i><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Orchestra Shell, Siegfried, Das Rheingold, Die Walküre, Rigoletto</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Lyric Opera </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Chicago), </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">In Parenthesis, War and Peace, Rigoletto, Flying Dutchman</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Welsh National </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Opera).</span></p>

