                        <div class="person__header">
                            <h3 class="type-h6">Ryan Denton</h3>

                                                            <p class="type-body-s">Assistant Stage Manager</p>
                            
                            <div class="person__header__flex">
                                
                                                            </div>
                        </div>

                                                    <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-6-5593">
                                <article class="person-dialog">
                                    
                                    <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                        <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                            <h2 class="type-h3">Ryan Denton</h2>

                                                                                            <p class="type-h5">Assistant Stage Manager</p>
                                                                                    </div>

                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ryan is a stage manager and creative with experience across a range of theatrical roles, dedicated to delivering impactful live experiences and productions. Alongside his stage management work, Ryan is the proud co-founder of Ordinary Stories Theatre CIC, a theatre company committed to providing creative opportunities in rural communities across the UK.</span></p>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                                            </li>
                                                                                                                                        
                    <li class="person not-prose no-image has-grey-background-color">
                                                                                    <button class="btn btn--square person__dialog-trigger btn--grey"
                                    data-dialog-open="people-6"
                                    data-dialog-content-template="dialog-person-6-8788">
                                    <span class="sr-only">Open Bio for Maya Bora Yeşil</span>
                                    <div class="btn__icon">
                                        <div class="mask-icon"
                                            style="--icon--url: url('/wp-content/themes/arcola-theatre-theme/public/images/plus.svg')"></div>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                                                    
                        <div class="person__header">
                            <h3 class="type-h6">Maya Bora Yeşil</h3>

                                                            <p class="type-body-s">Illustrator and Visual Artist</p>
                            
                            <div class="person__header__flex">
                                
                                                            </div>
                        </div>

                                                    <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-6-8788">
                                <article class="person-dialog">
                                    
                                    <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                        <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                            <h2 class="type-h3">Maya Bora Yeşil</h2>

                                                                                            <p class="type-h5">Illustrator and Visual Artist</p>
                                                                                    </div>

                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p dir="auto">Maya Bora is an award-winning illustrator and visual artist whose practice focuses on illustration, children’s publishing and exhibition-based work.</p>
<p dir="auto">She graduated from the Faculty of Fine Arts at Dokuz Eylül University. Her augmented reality children’s book project received the Best Thesis Award and won second prize at the IX International Design Education Forum in Ukraine.</p>
<p dir="auto">She has illustrated 12 children’s books published internationally, as well as a comic book published in the United States.</p>
<p dir="auto">With support from TÜBİTAK’s BiGG Entrepreneurship Programme, she founded Megami and, as art director, developed Okku, a platform enabling artists to create and publish interactive digital books.</p>
<p dir="auto">Her practice also includes selected interdisciplinary collaborations. She contributed to the poster and set design of <em>A New Year’s Dream (Bir Yılbaşı Rüyası)</em>, staged in İzmir. For Arcola Theatre’s production of <em>The Master Builder</em>, she designed, produced and hand-painted scale models for the set.</p>
<p dir="auto">Alongside her solo exhibitions, Maya collaborates with institutions on artistic and social projects. She also organises collective exhibitions raising awareness of street animals and continues to work internationally as an independent illustrator and visual artist.</p>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                                            </li>
                                                                                                                                        
                    <li class="person not-prose no-image has-grey-background-color">
                                                                                    <button class="btn btn--square person__dialog-trigger btn--grey"
                                    data-dialog-open="people-6"
                                    data-dialog-content-template="dialog-person-6-8094">
                                    <span class="sr-only">Open Bio for Yağmur Karabacak</span>
                                    <div class="btn__icon">
                                        <div class="mask-icon"
                                            style="--icon--url: url('/wp-content/themes/arcola-theatre-theme/public/images/plus.svg')"></div>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                                                    
                        <div class="person__header">
                            <h3 class="type-h6">Yağmur Karabacak</h3>

                                                            <p class="type-body-s">Design Placement</p>
                            
                            <div class="person__header__flex">
                                
                                                            </div>
                        </div>

                                                    <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-6-8094">
                                <article class="person-dialog">
                                    
                                    <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                        <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                            <h2 class="type-h3">Yağmur Karabacak</h2>

                                                                                            <p class="type-h5">Design Placement</p>
                                                                                    </div>

                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio margin-trim type-body-l">
                                            <p><span class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Yağmur Karabacak is an architect and theatre designer currently pursuing an MA in Theatre and Performance Design at Wimbledon College of Arts, University of the Arts London. With a strong foundation in architectural design, her practice explores the intersection of spatial dynamics, scenography, and movement within performance environments. Driven by an interest in contemporary movement and dance, her approach explores how physical performance shapes scenographic space, bridging structural precision with narrative design.</span></p>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                                            </li>
                                                                                                                                        
